1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,590
You're still trying.

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:04,438
So why does moving
forward feel harder?

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,275
Every day takes energy.

4
00:00:06,275 --> 00:00:08,728
Recovery keeps
getting put off.

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,605
When you've been worn down
for a while,

6
00:00:11,605 --> 00:00:13,763
the same things
can feel harder.

7
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,860
How your body feels

8
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:20,182
affects your drive
to keep going.

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:25,210
Make recovery
part of your plan,

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,710
so your body
can keep up

11
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,549
with where
you want to go.
